   812 				; Apply_Menu_Palettes - put the menu/info screen's palettes back in the
   813 				; hardware registers: set 0 = the de-interleaved text palette UI_Build_
   814 				; TextPalette left resident at VBXE $00800, sets 1-3 = the banner's R/G/B
   815 				; ramps, generated on the fly.  No disk access, no stored ramp data.
