   260 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   261 				; Build_Image_List - rebuild the selector list in IMAGE_BANK through the $2000
   262 				; window, grouped:  ".."  (only below the drive root)  |  sub-directories  |
   263 				; *.V1K files.  Rescan_Images sorts the two real groups A-Z afterwards.
   264 				; Sets ImageCount, Dir_Count and FileStart (index of the first *.V1K row).
   265 				;   - directory pass: OPEN "D[n]:PATH*.*" long DIR format (AUX2 = $80) and keep
   266 				;     only lines carrying SDX's "<DIR>" size-column tag (Line_Has_Dir_Tag).
   267 				;   - file pass:      OPEN "D[n]:PATH*.V1K" short format (AUX2 = $00) as before.
   268 				; One 8-byte write cursor (Name_Ptr) and one ImageNames_End guard span both.
   269 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   270 4F9C			Build_Image_List
   271 4F9C A9 00			lda #$00
   272 4F9E 8D 8B 04			sta ImageCount
   273 4FA1 8D 8C 04			sta ImageCount+1
   274 4FA4 8D D9 04			sta Dir_Count
   275
