   711 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   712 				; UI_Show_Busy - A/Y = lo/hi of a NUL-terminated message.  Shows it in row 0
   713 				; in the path's place ("Location: " stays, the rest of the row is blanked) and
   714 				; PRESENTS it at once: the caller is about to do slow disk I/O, during which
   715 				; no key loop runs.  The rest of the screen stays as it was.
   716 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
