  2086 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  2087 				; Selector_Handle_P - "P" key: show a 2x2 grid of ramp squares, one per
  2088 				; palette register, zoomed 7x and centered on the image screen (UI_Mode 6,
  2089 				; Esc-only - see Pal_Preview_Keys).
  2090 				;   * on a *.V1K row: "Reading palette..." in row 0, read the .PAL block to
  2091 				;     $21000 with the selector still up; a missing / short file leaves the
  2092 				;     selector up (row 0 restored).  Only once it has loaded is the preview
  2093 				;     built (unseen) and swapped in, with the registers rewritten under a
  2094 				;     blanked overlay.
  2095 				;   * on "..", a directory or an empty list: no disk access at all - the
  2096 				;     registers already hold the menu's own palettes 0-3, so just show them.
  2097 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  2098 5B82			Selector_Handle_P
