  2388 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  2389 				; Slideshow_Tick - called from main every frame.  Counts Slide_FrameCtr down
  2390 				; and advances to the next image at zero.  No-op unless UI_Mode = 2.
  2391 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  2392 5DAA			Slideshow_Tick
