  2437 5DF5			Slideshow_Reload_NoCarry
  2438 5DF5 CA				dex
  2439 5DF6 D0 EF			bne Slideshow_Reload_L1
  2440 5DF8			Slideshow_Reload_Done
  2441 5DF8 60				rts
